## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to manage multi-tool CI/CD in large orgs; addresses reliability, consistency, and deployment safety across platforms, especially with monorepos and Kubernetes.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-Platform Orchestration
- Monorepo Build Consistency
- Artifact Tagging Strategy
- Secrets Management across Runners
- Blue/Green and Canary Deployments

